     A*                                     TOKUIM (model answer, lesson 10-02):
     A*                                     db/v1/tokuim.pf plus TOKYSN.
     A*                                     TOKYSN = credit limit, 7S 0.
     A*                                     No DFT: rows that exist before
     A*                                     CHGPF get zero (checked by
     A*                                     verify/part10-02-tokuim).
     A*                                     Record format name stays
     A*                                     TOKUIR, so TOKUIL1 (no field
     A*                                     list) needs no source change.
     A          R TOKUIR                    TEXT('Customer master')
     A            TOKCD          6A         TEXT('Customer code')
     A            TOKNM         30A         TEXT('Customer name')
     A            TOKZIP         7A         TEXT('Zip code')
     A            TOKTAN         6A         TEXT('Sales rep code')
     A            TOKUPD         8S 0       TEXT('Updated date YYYYMMDD')
     A            TOKYSN         7S 0       TEXT('Credit limit')
     A          K TOKCD
